								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16729#msg16729"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16729#msg16729">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #86 on:</b> May 01, 2005, 07:17:51 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I think Time instancing is still a couple months away, so we&#039;ll have to deal with what we have for a while yet.<br /><br />Moonlight Crusaders has Time down to a one-day clear now.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
