	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16825"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1149" title="View the profile of Dirvani">Dirvani</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 1<br />
								<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=1149"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:Dirvani@hotmail.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16825#msg16825"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16825#msg16825">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #88 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 06:27:44 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							From what has been posted in this thread, guessing it&#039;s looking something like this now:<br /><br />1.&nbsp; Vis Maior  (Entrenched in Aguish)<br />2-3.&nbsp; DA/EiE and Wraith/Rev.  (Anguish)<br />4.&nbsp; Cold Fury (Txevu/advancing on Anguish)<br />5.&nbsp; Conviction (Coming out of Time, various stages of GoD)<br />6.&nbsp; Moonlight Crusaders (Time Farming)<br />7.&nbsp; Dawning Nemesis  (Time Farming)<br />8.&nbsp; Union of Power (Time...)<br />9.&nbsp; Underguild (About to begin Time)<br />10.  Inner Loop (still missing Coirnav?)<br />11.&nbsp; Radiant (FR kill, Poe B)<br />12.  Outcast Adventurers (Fennin Ro killed)<br />13-14.&nbsp; BrewMasters and Vinceremo (Killed Sol Ro, about to start raiding elementals)<br />15.  League of Sozobon (kill Agnar and Bert)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									&#171; <i>Last Edit: May 03, 2005, 06:30:22 pm by Dirvani</i> &#187;
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg16826"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg2">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146" title="View the profile of simplee">simplee</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Hill Giant<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Gender: <img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/Female.gif" alt="Female" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 246<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/devil1.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								smoked again................    ranger down!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=146"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16826#msg16826"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16826#msg16826">Re: Top Ten Quellious/Rodcet Nife Guilds</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #89 on:</b> May 03, 2005, 06:51:07 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div class="quoteheader"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=1506.msg16825#msg16825">Quote from: Dirvani on May 03, 2005, 06:27:44 pm</a></div><div class="quote">From what has been posted in this thread, guessing it&#039;s looking something like this now:<br /><br />1.  Vis Maior  (Entrenched in Aguish)<br />2-3.  DA/EiE and Wraith/Rev.  (Anguish)<br />4.  Cold Fury (Txevu/advancing on Anguish)<br />5.  Conviction (Coming out of Time, various stages of GoD)<br />6.  Moonlight Crusaders (Time Farming)<br />7.  Dawning Nemesis  (Time Farming)<br />8.  Union of Power (Time...)<br />9.  Underguild (About to begin Time)<br />10.  Inner Loop (still missing Coirnav?)<br />11.  Radiant (FR kill, Poe B)<br />12.  Outcast Adventurers (Fennin Ro killed)<br />13-14.  BrewMasters and Vinceremo (Killed Sol Ro, about to start raiding elementals)<br />15.  League of Sozobon (kill Agnar and Bert)<br /></div><br />Conviction is pretty firmly in Txevu now.&nbsp; <br />We work on DoN progression occasionally, along with various OoW targets (Queen down).<br /><br />Inner Loop is Time flagged now, so they&#039;re probably tied with Underguild, and I&#039;d probably put UoP on that same tied number to make it a three-way tie.<br /><br />Looks like 5 guilds will be vying for Time when the merger happens next week - has anyone tried discussing a rotation?&nbsp; As far as I know, only MC can clear it in one day.
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
								</td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
									<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/ip.gif" alt="" border="0" /> Logged
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />Huntress Simplee Mee<br />70 Plainswalker
						</td>
					</tr>
				</table>
			</td></tr>
		</table>
	</td></tr>
</table>
